WEBVTT

00:05:28.404 --> 00:05:31.668
uu U.K usoo qaxay sanadii 1960s.

00:05:31.668 --> 00:05:35.798
wuxuu lahaa salaxyo iyo shaarbo nidaamsan.

00:05:35.798 --> 00:05:38.417
markii hore si fiican ay usoo baxeysay

00:05:38.417 --> 00:05:41.467
xita waxan dukaamada India ka helayay qiima dhimis.

00:05:41.467 --> 00:05:45.468
(Qosol)

00:05:45.468 --> 00:05:47.092
Laakin si dhaqso,

00:05:47.092 --> 00:05:48.839
xitaa waxan bilaabay inaan quursado

00:05:48.839 --> 00:05:50.519
awooda koritaan ee shaarbaheyga,

00:05:50.519 --> 00:05:53.921
aad ayuu u weeynaaday.

00:05:53.921 --> 00:05:56.668
Indian maba u ekeen.

00:05:56.668 --> 00:05:58.511
Halkii aay, dadka wadada marayay,

00:05:58.511 --> 00:06:00.402
aay ku qeelinayeen hadalo sida---